  m_text: "FAMILY A (UXML / Text Reveal / USS Class) directly mutates the live VisualElement tree via ReversibleEffectSystem; NO track binding (addressed by string id), reverts on clip exit \u2014 STRUCTURAL here (needs a live Anchor app RootVisualElement + IUXMLService + named elements, none of which ship in an isolated showcase). FAMILY B (Number / Data Display / Essence UI) folds active clips into a ViewModel binding; Number/Essence have NO binding, Data binds Transform, Essence binds StatAuthoring \u2014 NUMERIC here (baked components + folded ECS data observable; HUD pixels need a project panel binding the ViewModel). Every director: TimelineBegin OnLoad, FixedLength + Loop."
